sequenceDiagram
accTitle: The vendor binds role assumption to the requesting customer
accDescr: Requests for the intended customer carry its external ID and can assume the audit role. Another customer cannot use that role by merely supplying its ARN because the vendor sends a different customer ID.
participant V as Vendor service
participant S as STS trust evaluation
participant R as Customer audit resources
V->>S: Assume audit role, intended customer's external ID
S-->>V: Scoped temporary session
V->>R: Authorized EC2 discovery request
V->>S: Same role ARN, different customer's external ID
S-->>V: Denied, external ID does not match
Note over V,S: Vendor chooses the ID from its trusted customer mapping
